OL,3,APolanski vows to stay on as Green
OL,4,Aleader as criticism mounts
OL,5,
OL,6,FZack Polanski has vowed to stay on as
OL,7,FGreen Party leader after his
OL,8,Fby-election defeat, as he faced
OL,9,Fpressure from within his own party to
OL,10,Fresign.
OL,12,FThe leader of the Jewish Greens, Vivien
OL,13,FLichtenstein, said on Friday he should
OL,14,Fresign, adding it was a "big mistake"
OL,15,Ffor him to have dodged a debate about a
OL,16,Fparty conference motion that declared
OL,17,FZionism a form of racism.
OL,19,FLichtenstein's comments come after
OL,20,Fformer Green Party leader Caroline
OL,21,FLucas accused Polanski of failing to
OL,22,Fshow leadership over the Zionism row.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
