OL,3,APolanski vows to stay on as Green
OL,4,Aleader as criticism mounts
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolanski, who came second to Labour
OL,7,Fovernight in the Holborn and St Pancras
OL,8,Fby-election, told BBC Breakfast he
OL,9,Fwould "absolutely" stay on as leader
OL,10,Fand "of course" had not questioned
OL,11,Fthat.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
